    "cli.help.notify": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux notify [flags]\n\nSend a notification to a workspace/surface, or clear that resolved target with --clear.\n\nFlags:\n  --title <text>         Notification title (default: \"Notification\")\n  --subtitle <text>      Notification subtitle\n  --body <text>          Notification body\n  --reply                Allow a free-text inline reply\n  --desktop <true|false> Post a native macOS banner (default: true). false keeps the entry in the Notifications panel, sidebar badge and pane ring without a banner\n  --clear                Clear notifications for the resolved caller/target instead of posting\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Target workspace, except explicit surface UUIDs resolve globally\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Target surface (refs/indexes use workspace/window context)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Window context for workspace/surface refs and indexes\n  --json                 Print the response payload as JSON\n  --id-format <mode>     refs, uuids, or both for human-readable ids\n\nThe response includes the created notification id. Use cmux dismiss-notification --id <uuid|notification:<uuid>>, cmux list-notifications, or cmux clear-notifications to manage notifications.\n--desktop sets the notification's desktop effect before notification hooks run; hooks can still override it. It has no effect with --clear.\n\nExample:\n  cmux notify --title \"Build done\" --body \"All tests passed\"\n  cmux notify --title \"Error\" --subtitle \"test.swift\" --body \"Line 42: syntax error\"\n  cmux notify --surface <uuid> --title \"Build done\"\n  cmux notify --title \"Deploy finished\" --desktop false\n  cmux notify --clear"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux notify [flags]\n\n向工作区/表面发送通知，或使用 --clear 清除已解析的目标。\n\nFlags：\n  --title <text>         通知标题（默认值：\"Notification\"）\n  --subtitle <text>      通知副标题\n  --body <text>          通知正文\n  --reply                允许自由文本内联回复\n  --desktop <true|false> 显示 macOS 原生横幅（默认值：true）。为 false 时，不显示横幅，但会在通知面板、侧边栏徽章和窗格环中保留条目\n  --clear                清除已解析调用方/目标的通知，而不是发布通知\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   目标工作区，但显式的表面 UUID 会全局解析\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     目标表面（引用/索引使用工作区/窗口上下文）\n  --window <id|ref|index>      工作区/表面引用和索引的窗口上下文\n  --json                 将响应负载打印为 JSON\n  --id-format <mode>     便于阅读的 ID 格式：refs、uuids 或 both\n\n响应包含创建的通知 ID。使用 cmux dismiss-notification --id <uuid|notification:<uuid>>、cmux list-notifications 或 cmux clear-notifications 管理通知。\n--desktop 会在运行通知钩子前设置通知的 desktop 效果；钩子仍可覆盖该设置。与 --clear 一起使用时无效。\n\n示例：\n  cmux notify --title \"Build done\" --body \"All tests passed\"\n  cmux notify --title \"Error\" --subtitle \"test.swift\" --body \"Line 42: syntax error\"\n  cmux notify --surface <uuid> --title \"Build done\"\n  cmux notify --title \"Deploy finished\" --desktop false\n  cmux notify --clear"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.notify.clear": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "--clear                Clear notifications for the resolved caller/target instead of posting"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "--clear                清除已解析目标的通知，而不是发布"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.notify.management": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The response includes the created notification id. Use cmux dismiss-notification --id <uuid>, cmux list-notifications, or cmux clear-notifications to manage notifications."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "响应包含创建的通知 ID。使用 cmux 命令管理通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.notify.reply": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "--reply                Allow a free-text inline reply"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "--reply                允许自由文本内联回复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.vault.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux vault <subcommand> [options]\n\nBrowse, search, checkpoint, and fork agent sessions from the Vault index.\n\nSubcommands:\n  sessions [--agent <id>] [--folder <path>] [--limit <n>]\n      List indexed agent sessions, newest first.\n  search <query> [--limit <n>]\n      Search sessions. Supports agent:, repo:, ws:, before:/after:\n      operators and quoted phrases, ranked by recency.\n  checkpoints --agent <id> --session <id>\n      List a session's checkpoint timeline (derived turns + manual).\n  checkpoint --agent <id> --session <id> [--name <text>]\n      Create a manual named checkpoint at the session's current tip.\n  fork --agent <id> --session <id> (--checkpoint <id> | --turn <n>) [--open]\n      Fork a new session from a checkpoint. Prints the new session id\n      and its resume command; --open also opens it in a new workspace.\n\nAll subcommands support --json for machine-readable output."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux vault <subcommand> [options]\n\n从 Vault 索引中浏览、搜索、创建检查点并分叉代理会话。\n\n子命令:\n  sessions [--agent <id>] [--folder <path>] [--limit <n>]\n      列出已索引的代理会话，最新的在前。\n  search <query> [--limit <n>]\n      搜索会话。支持 agent:、repo:、ws:、before:/after:\n      操作符与带引号的短语，按时间新旧排序。\n  checkpoints --agent <id> --session <id>\n      列出某个会话的检查点时间线（派生的轮次 + 手动创建）。\n  checkpoint --agent <id> --session <id> [--name <text>]\n      在会话当前顶端创建一个手动命名的检查点。\n  fork --agent <id> --session <id> (--checkpoint <id> | --turn <n>) [--open]\n      从某个检查点分叉出新会话。打印新会话 id\n      及其恢复命令；加 --open 还会在新工作区中打开它。\n\n所有子命令都支持 --json 以输出机器可读格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
