            "value": "cmux could not start the command-line tool from the app bundle. Reinstall cmux or run the command from a standard cmux CLI installation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "cmux 无法从应用包中启动命令行工具。请重新安装 cmux，或从标准的 cmux CLI 安装中运行该命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.forwarding.error.missingBundledCLI": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "cmux could not run this command from the app bundle. Reinstall cmux or run the command from a standard cmux CLI installation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "cmux 无法从应用包中运行此命令。请重新安装 cmux，或从标准的 cmux CLI 安装中运行该命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.clearNotifications": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux clear-notifications [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--surface <id|ref|index>] [--window <id|ref|index>]\n\nClear queued notifications, optionally scoped to a workspace and surface.\n\nFlags: --workspace <id|ref|index> --surface <id|ref|index> --window <id|ref|index>"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法: cmux clear-notifications [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--surface <id|ref|index>] [--window <id|ref|index>]\n\n清除队列中的通知，可选择将作用域限制在工作区和表面。\n\n标志: --workspace <id|ref|index> --surface <id|ref|index> --window <id|ref|index>"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.dismissNotification": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux dismiss-notification (--id <uuid> | --all-read)\n\nRemove one notification, or remove every already-read notification.\n\nFlags:\n  --id <uuid>           Notification id to remove\n  --all-read            Remove every already-read notification\n  --json                Print JSON\n  --id-format <mode>    refs, uuids, or both"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux dismiss-notification (--id <uuid> | --all-read)\n\n移除一条通知，或移除所有已读通知。\n\n标志:\n  --id <uuid>           要移除的通知 id\n  --all-read            移除所有已读通知\n  --json                输出 JSON\n  --id-format <mode>    refs、uuids 或 both"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.ios": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ios <subcommand> [args] [--surface <id|ref|index>]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.irohDiag": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux iroh-diag\n\nPrint the host's Iroh Connection Report as a plain-language timeline,\nthe same data as Settings > Networking > Connection Report."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux iroh-diag\n\n以易读的时间线形式输出主机的 Iroh 连接报告，\n数据与“设置 > 网络 > 连接报告”相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.jumpToUnread": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux jump-to-unread\n\nFocus the latest unread notification, matching the Notifications page action.\n\nFlags:\n  --json                Print JSON\n  --id-format <mode>    refs, uuids, or both"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux jump-to-unread\n\n聚焦最新的未读通知，与通知页面上的操作一致。\n\n标志:\n  --json                输出 JSON\n  --id-format <mode>    refs、uuids 或 both"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.markNotificationRead": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux mark-notification-read (--id <uuid> | --workspace <id|ref> [--surface <id|ref>] | --all)\n\nMark notifications read without opening them. Exactly one selector is required.\n\nFlags:\n  --id <uuid>           Mark one notification read\n  --workspace <id|ref>  Mark notifications for a workspace\n  --surface <id|ref>    Narrow --workspace to one surface\n  --all                 Mark every notification read\n  --json                Print JSON\n  --id-format <mode>    refs, uuids, or both"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux mark-notification-read (--id <uuid> | --workspace <id|ref> [--surface <id|ref>] | --all)\n\n不打开通知即将其标记为已读。必须且只能指定一个选择器。\n\n标志:\n  --id <uuid>           将一条通知标记为已读\n  --workspace <id|ref>  标记某个工作区的通知\n  --surface <id|ref>    将 --workspace 缩小到某个表面\n  --all                 将所有通知标记为已读\n  --json                输出 JSON\n  --id-format <mode>    refs、uuids 或 both"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.memory": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux memory [flags]\n\nDiagnose cmux app memory separately from recursive terminal child-process RSS.\n\nFlags:\n  --all                         Include all windows (default: current window only)\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Limit workspace context for attribution labels\n  --groups <count>              Number of child command groups to show (default: 12)\n  --json                        Structured JSON output\n\nOutput:\n  App footprint is the direct cmux process physical footprint from macOS process accounting.\n  Child RSS is recursive resident memory for descendants of the cmux app process,\n  grouped by command name and attributed back to workspace, pane, and surface when known.\n\nExample:\n  cmux memory\n  cmux memory --groups 20\n  cmux --json memory --all"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux memory [flags]\n\n将 cmux 应用内存与终端子进程的递归 RSS 分开诊断。\n\n标志:\n  --all                         包含所有窗口（默认：仅当前窗口）\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   限制归因标签的工作区上下文\n  --groups <count>              要显示的子命令组数量（默认：12）\n  --json                        结构化 JSON 输出\n\n输出:\n  应用 footprint 是 macOS 进程统计中 cmux 进程的直接物理 footprint。\n  Child RSS 是 cmux 应用进程后代的递归驻留内存，\n  按命令名分组，并在已知时归因到工作区、窗格和 surface。\n\n示例:\n  cmux memory\n  cmux memory --groups 20\n  cmux --json memory --all"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.mosh": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux mosh <destination> [flags] [-- <remote-command-args>]\n\nMosh terminal transport:\n  --transport <ssh|mosh>  Interactive terminal transport (default: mosh)\n\nSSH continues to handle remote features; Mosh carries only the interactive\nterminal. If Mosh is missing locally or remotely, cmux reports it and uses SSH.\n\nExample:\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --transport mosh\n\n  cmux mosh dev@my-host"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法: cmux mosh <destination> [flags] [-- <remote-command-args>]\n\nMosh 终端传输：\n  --transport <ssh|mosh>  交互式终端传输（默认：mosh）\n\nSSH 继续处理远程功能；Mosh 仅承载交互式\n终端。如果本地或远程缺少 Mosh，cmux 会进行报告并使用 SSH。\n\n示例：\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --transport mosh\n\n  cmux mosh dev@my-host"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.mosh-tmux": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux mosh-tmux <destination> [--session <name>] [flags]\n\nCreate a Mosh workspace that creates or attaches to a named tmux session (default: main). The tmux profile persists across reconnect and app session restore. This is a roaming tmux terminal, not the native mirror from cmux ssh-tmux. --session <name> selects the session; all other flags match cmux mosh. Without Mosh, the same profile runs over SSH.\n\nExample:\n  cmux mosh-tmux dev@my-host\n  cmux mosh-tmux dev@my-host --session agent-main"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法: cmux mosh-tmux <destination> [--session <name>] [flags]\n\n创建一个 Mosh 工作区，用于创建或附加命名的 tmux 会话（默认：main）。tmux 配置会在重连和应用会话恢复后保留。这是可漫游的 tmux 终端，而不是 cmux ssh-tmux 的原生镜像。--session <name> 选择会话；其他选项与 cmux mosh 相同。没有 Mosh 时，同一配置会通过 SSH 运行。\n\n示例:\n  cmux mosh-tmux dev@my-host\n  cmux mosh-tmux dev@my-host --session agent-main"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.openNotification": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux open-notification --id <uuid>\n\nFocus the notification's workspace and surface, then mark the row read.\n\nFlags:\n  --id <uuid>           Notification id to open\n  --json                Print JSON\n  --id-format <mode>    refs, uuids, or both"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux open-notification --id <uuid>\n\n聚焦该通知所属的工作区和表面，然后将该行标记为已读。\n\n标志:\n  --id <uuid>           要打开的通知 id\n  --json                输出 JSON\n  --id-format <mode>    refs、uuids 或 both"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.reorderWorkspaces": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux reorder-workspaces --order <id|ref|index>,<id|ref|index>,... [flags]\n\nReorder workspaces within a window as one atomic batch. The comma-separated\norder is the final leading order inside the pinned and unpinned groups;\nunmentioned workspaces keep their relative order after listed peers in the\nsame group.\n\nFlags:\n  --order <refs>                Comma-separated workspace refs to place first\n  --window <id|ref|index>       Window context\n  --dry-run                     Print the resolved final indexes without applying\n\nExample:\n  cmux reorder-workspaces --order workspace:1,workspace:11,workspace:31\n  cmux reorder-workspaces --order workspace:11,workspace:1 --dry-run"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法: cmux reorder-workspaces --order <id|ref|index>,<id|ref|index>,... [flags]\n\n将窗口内的工作区作为一个原子批次进行重新排序。以逗号分隔的\n顺序是已固定和未固定组内的最终前导顺序；\n未提及的工作区在相同组中列出的同辈之后保持其相对顺序\n。\n\n标志：\n  --order <refs>                逗号分隔的工作区引用，放在最前面\n  --window <id|ref|index>       窗口上下文\n  --dry-run                     打印解析后的最终索引而不应用\n\n示例：\n  cmux reorder-workspaces --order workspace:1,workspace:11,workspace:31\n  cmux reorder-workspaces --order workspace:11,workspace:1 --dry-run"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.restore": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "restore [--surface <id|ref>] <kind> <checkpoint-id> | restore --surface [id|ref]"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "restore [--surface <id|ref>] <kind> <checkpoint-id> | restore --surface [id|ref]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.setStatus": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux set-status <key> <value> [flags]\n\nSet a sidebar status entry for a workspace. Status entries appear as\npills in the sidebar tab row. Use a unique key so different tools\n(e.g. \"claude_code\", \"build\") can manage their own entries.\n\nFlags:\n  --icon <name>          Icon name (e.g. \"sparkle\", \"hammer\")\n  --color <#hex>         Pill color (e.g. \"#ff9500\")\n                         \"#4C8DFF\" draws as the cmux accent (app.accentColor)\n  --priority <n>         Sort priority; higher appears first (default: 0)\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Target workspace (default: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Window context for workspace refs and indexes\n\nExample:\n  cmux set-status build \"compiling\" --icon hammer --color \"#ff9500\" --priority 80\n  cmux set-status deploy \"v1.2.3\" --workspace workspace:2"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux set-status <key> <value> [flags]\n\n为工作区设置一个侧边栏状态条目。状态条目会以胶囊标签的形式\n显示在侧边栏的标签页行中。请使用唯一的 key，让不同工具\n（例如 \"claude_code\"、\"build\"）各自管理自己的条目。\n\n标志：\n  --icon <name>          图标名称（例如 \"sparkle\"、\"hammer\"）\n  --color <#hex>         胶囊标签颜色（例如 \"#ff9500\"）\n                         \"#4C8DFF\" 以 cmux 强调色显示（app.accentColor）\n  --priority <n>         排序优先级；数值越大越靠前（默认：0）\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   目标工作区（默认：$CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID）\n  --window <id|ref|index>      工作区引用和索引所在的窗口上下文\n\n示例：\n  cmux set-status build \"compiling\" --icon hammer --color \"#ff9500\" --priority 80\n  cmux set-status deploy \"v1.2.3\" --workspace workspace:2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.simulator": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
