    "cli.localTmux.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux local-tmux <start|attach|list|status|detach|close|cleanup> [session] [options]\n\nOpt-in local tmux sessions survive cmux quit, crash, and app updates. Ordinary cmux terminals are unchanged.\n\nstart <name> [--cwd <path>] [--command <shell>] [--detached]\nattach <name|--id <uuid>> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--focus <true|false>] [--headless] [--new-client]\nlist [--json]\nstatus <name|--id <uuid>> [--json]\ndetach <name|--id <uuid>> [--client <id> | --all]\nclose <name|--id <uuid>>\ncleanup [--prune]\n\nThe registry and tmux server socket live under ~/.cmux/local-tmux with user-only permissions. `attach --headless` hands the terminal directly to tmux for a client outside the cmux GUI."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法: cmux local-tmux <start|attach|list|status|detach|close|cleanup> [session] [options]\n\n选择加入的本地 tmux 会话在 cmux 退出、崩溃和应用更新时仍能存活。普通的 cmux 终端不受影响。\n\nstart <name> [--cwd <path>] [--command <shell>] [--detached]\nattach <name|--id <uuid>> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--focus <true|false>] [--headless] [--new-client]\nlist [--json]\nstatus <name|--id <uuid>> [--json]\ndetach <name|--id <uuid>> [--client <id> | --all]\nclose <name|--id <uuid>>\ncleanup [--prune]\n\n注册表和 tmux 服务器套接字位于具有仅用户权限的 ~/.cmux/local-tmux 下。`attach --headless` 会将终端直接移交给 tmux，以便在 cmux GUI 之外运行客户端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.ssh": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux ssh <destination> [flags] [-- <remote-command-args>]\n\nCreate a new workspace, mark it as remote-SSH, and start an SSH session in that workspace.\ncmux will also establish a local SSH proxy endpoint so browser traffic can egress from the remote host.\n\nFlags:\n  --name <title>          Optional workspace title\n  --port <n>              SSH port\n  --identity <path>       SSH identity file path\n  -A, --forward-agent     Forward the caller's SSH agent; also honors ForwardAgent yes from ssh_config\n  -a, --no-forward-agent  Disable SSH agent forwarding for this workspace\n  --ssh-option <opt>      Extra SSH -o option (repeatable)\n  --window <id|ref|index> Target window for the managed workspace\n  --no-focus              Create workspace without switching to it\n\nExample:\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --name \"gpu-box\" --port 2222 --identity ~/.ssh/id_ed25519\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --forward-agent\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --ssh-option UserKnownHostsFile=/dev/null --ssh-option StrictHostKeyChecking=no"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux ssh <destination> [flags] [-- <remote-command-args>]\n\n创建一个新工作区，将其标记为 remote-SSH，并在该工作区中启动 SSH 会话。\ncmux 还会建立本地 SSH 代理端点，使浏览器流量可以从远程主机发出。\n\nFlags:\n  --name <title>          可选的工作区标题\n  --port <n>              SSH 端口\n  --identity <path>       SSH identity 文件路径\n  -A, --forward-agent     转发调用方的 SSH agent；也会遵循 ssh_config 中的 ForwardAgent yes\n  -a, --no-forward-agent  为此工作区禁用 SSH agent 转发\n  --ssh-option <opt>      额外的 SSH -o 选项（可重复）\n  --window <id|ref|index> 托管工作区的目标窗口\n  --no-focus              创建工作区但不切换到它\n\nExample:\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --name \"gpu-box\" --port 2222 --identity ~/.ssh/id_ed25519\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --forward-agent\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --ssh-option UserKnownHostsFile=/dev/null --ssh-option StrictHostKeyChecking=no"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.ssh-tmux": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux ssh-tmux <destination> [--port <n>] [--identity <path>] [--name <title>]\n                     [--transport ssh|et] [--transport-port <n>] [--broker <name>] [--no-focus]\n\nMirror a remote host's tmux sessions into the current window's sidebar over\nSSH tmux control mode (tmux -CC). Each session becomes a workspace, each\nwindow a tab, and each multi-pane window a native split. Requires the\n\"Remote tmux\" beta setting.\n\nIf the host needs interactive authentication (password, host-key confirmation,\nMFA, or a security-key touch), cmux runs ssh inline in this terminal so you can\nauthenticate, then mirrors the sessions over the shared SSH connection. Hosts\nthat authenticate non-interactively (ssh-agent / key in ~/.ssh/config) mirror\nwith no prompt. ~/.ssh/config aliases and their IdentityFile/ProxyJump/Port settings are honored.\n\nFlags:\n  --port <n>            SSH port\n  --identity <path>     SSH identity file path\n  --name <title>        Set the mirrored workspace's local display title. This is\n                        cosmetic only: it does not rename the remote tmux session.\n                        Applies to the first newly-mirrored session when the host\n                        has more than one.\n  --transport <name>    ssh (default) or et. et carries the control stream over EternalTerminal, which reconnects on its own after a network change\n  --transport-port <n>  Port the transport connects to: sshd's for ssh, etserver's for et (default 22 for ssh, 2022 for et)\n  --broker <name>       Reach the host through a broker declared under remoteTmux.brokers in cmux.json (a named entry, not a command)\n  --no-focus            Do not select the mirror workspace or focus its window\n\nExample:\n  cmux ssh-tmux dev@my-host\n  cmux ssh-tmux dev@my-host --port 2222 --identity ~/.ssh/id_ed25519\n  cmux ssh-tmux dev@my-host --name \"prod db\"\n  cmux ssh-tmux dev@my-host --transport et --transport-port 8080\n  cmux ssh-tmux my-host --transport et --broker corp"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux ssh-tmux <destination> [--port <n>] [--identity <path>] [--name <title>]\n                 [--transport ssh|et] [--transport-port <n>] [--broker <name>] [--no-focus]\n\n通过 SSH tmux 控制模式（tmux -CC），将远程主机的 tmux 会话镜像到当前窗口的\n侧边栏中。每个会话成为一个工作区，每个窗口成为一个标签页，每个多窗格\n窗口成为一个原生分栏。需要启用“Remote tmux”测试版\n设置。\n\n如果主机需要交互式身份验证（密码、主机密钥确认、\nMFA 或触碰安全密钥），cmux 会在此终端中直接运行 ssh，以便您完成\n验证，然后通过共享的 SSH 连接镜像会话。以非交互方式完成验证的主机\n（ssh-agent / ~/.ssh/config 中的密钥）会直接镜像，\n无需提示。系统会采用 ~/.ssh/config 中的别名及其 IdentityFile/ProxyJump/Port 设置。\n\n标志：\n  --port <n>            SSH 端口\n  --identity <path>     SSH 身份文件路径\n  --name <title>        设置镜像工作区的本地显示标题。此设置\n                        仅影响显示：不会重命名远程 tmux 会话。\n                        当主机有多个会话时，仅应用于第一个\n                        新镜像的会话。\n  --transport <name>    ssh（默认）或 et。et 通过 EternalTerminal 传输控制流，网络切换后会自行重新连接\n  --transport-port <n>  传输所连接的端口：ssh 为 sshd 的端口，et 为 etserver 的端口（默认 ssh 为 22，et 为 2022）\n  --broker <name>       通过 cmux.json 中 remoteTmux.brokers 下声明的代理连接主机（指定的是已命名的条目，而不是命令）\n  --no-focus            不选择镜像工作区，也不聚焦其窗口\n\n示例：\n  cmux ssh-tmux dev@my-host\n  cmux ssh-tmux dev@my-host --port 2222 --identity ~/.ssh/id_ed25519\n  cmux ssh-tmux dev@my-host --name \"prod db\"\n  cmux ssh-tmux dev@my-host --transport et --transport-port 8080\n  cmux ssh-tmux my-host --transport et --broker corp"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.ssh-tmux.newWindow": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Additional flag:\n  --new-window        Open the mirror in a dedicated new window"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他选项:\n  --new-window        在专用的新窗口中打开镜像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.ssh.initialCommand": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Initial command:\n  --command <text>        Run text once in the initial remote terminal after shell startup\n\nExample:\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --command 'omp \"investigate auth\"'"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "初始命令：\n  --command <text>        在 shell 启动后于初始远程终端中运行一次命令文本\n\n示例：\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --command 'omp \"investigate auth\"'"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.ssh.mosh": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mosh terminal transport:\n  --transport <ssh|mosh>  Interactive terminal transport (default: ssh)\n\nSSH continues to handle remote features; Mosh carries only the interactive\nterminal. If Mosh is missing locally or remotely, cmux reports it and uses SSH.\n\nExample:\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --transport mosh"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mosh 终端传输：\n  --transport <ssh|mosh>  交互式终端传输（默认：ssh）\n\nSSH 继续处理远程功能；Mosh 仅承载交互式\n终端。如果本地或远程缺少 Mosh，cmux 会进行报告并使用 SSH。\n\n示例：\n  cmux ssh dev@my-host --transport mosh"
          }
        }
      }
    },
