    "cli.sidebar.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux sidebar <templates|try|new|validate|reload|select|open> [name|--all] [--json]\nValidate, reload, select, or open custom sidebars from ~/.config/cmux/sidebars.\nCommands:\n  templates [--json] List the curated built-in templates\n  try <template>    Create a temporary preview file and show open/remove commands\n  new <name> --from <template> [--force]\n                     Install an editable sidebar from a template\n  validate [name]   Validate all custom sidebars, or one named sidebar\n  reload [name]     Validate all sidebars, then reload every valid one\n  select <name>     Activate one custom sidebar\n  open <name>       Open one custom sidebar as a Bonsplit pane"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux sidebar <templates|try|new|validate|reload|select|open> [name|--all] [--json]\n校验、重新加载、选择或打开自定义侧边栏。\n命令：\n  templates [--json] 列出精选内置模板\n  try <template>    创建临时预览并显示打开和删除命令\n  new <name> --from <template> [--force]\n                     从模板安装可编辑的侧边栏\n  validate [name]   校验所有自定义侧边栏或指定侧边栏\n  reload [name]     校验后重新加载每个有效侧边栏\n  select <name>     激活自定义侧边栏\n  open <name>       将自定义侧边栏作为 Bonsplit 窗格打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
