            "value": "请先选择一个 Cloud VM 工作区，然后重试此命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "command.cloudVM.current.missing.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Cloud VM Selected"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未选择 Cloud VM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "command.cloudVM.failed.action.exit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open a terminal and run `cmux auth status`, `cmux vm ls`, then `cmux vm base open`. If you hit the active VM limit, delete one with `cmux vm rm <id>` and retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请打开终端依次运行 `cmux auth status`、`cmux vm ls`，然后运行 `cmux vm base open`。若达到了活跃 VM 上限，用 `cmux vm rm <id>` 删除一台后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "command.cloudVM.failed.action.delete": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refresh the Machines list and retry. A machine that no longer exists is removed from the list automatically. To see the full output, run `cmux vm rm <id>` in a terminal."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请刷新机器列表后重试。已不存在的机器会自动从列表中移除。若要查看完整输出，请在终端中运行 `cmux vm rm <id>`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "command.cloudVM.failed.action.generic": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retry, or run the Cloud VM command in a terminal to see the full output."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请重试，或在终端中运行该 Cloud VM 命令以查看完整输出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "command.cloudVM.failed.action.rename": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A label is printable text of at most 64 characters. Retry, or run `cmux vm rename <id> <label>` in a terminal to see the full output."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标签为不超过 64 个字符的可打印文本。请重试，或在终端中运行 `cmux vm rename <id> <label>` 以查看完整输出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "command.cloudVM.failed.action.launch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reload cmux so its command-line tools are available, then retry. If it still fails, run the Cloud VM command in a terminal and send us the output."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请重新加载 cmux，使其命令行工具可用，然后重试。若仍然失败，请在终端中运行该 Cloud VM 命令，并把输出发给我们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "command.cloudVM.failed.action.missingCLI": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install or reload a fresh cmux build, then retry. You can also run the Cloud VM command in a terminal to see the full error."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
