          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘1…9 将选择当前窗格中的标签页，而不是工作区。工作区改用 ⌥⌘1…9。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.send": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux send [flags] [--] <text>\n\nSend text to a terminal surface as keystrokes. Escape sequences: \\n and \\r send Enter, \\t sends Tab.\n\nFor large text (for example over 4 KB, or several lines going to an agent), use --paste or cmux paste. Keystrokes press Enter at every newline, which can submit each line on its own.\n\nWith --paste, the text goes through the same paste path as cmux paste and Cmd+V, unchanged: escape sequences such as \\n are not interpreted, and control characters such as Esc and Ctrl-C are replaced with spaces. --paste must come before the text.\n\nIf an agent prompt in the target holds text someone is typing, or a question or permission dialog is open, nothing is sent and the command fails. --force sends anyway.\n\nFlags:\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   Target workspace (default: $CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID)\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     Target surface (default: $CMUX_SURFACE_ID)\n  --window <id|ref|index>      Window context for workspace/surface refs and indexes\n  --paste                      Paste the text instead of typing it\n  --force                      Send even over a draft or into an open dialog\n\nExample:\n  cmux send \"echo hello\"\n  cmux send --surface surface:2 \"ls -la\\n\"\n  cmux send --paste --surface surface:2 \"$(cat notes.md)\""
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux send [flags] [--] <text>\n\n以按键方式将文本发送到终端表面。转义序列：\\n 和 \\r 发送 Enter，\\t 发送 Tab。\n\n对于大量文本（例如超过 4 KB，或要发给代理的多行文本），请使用 --paste 或 cmux paste。按键方式会在每个换行处按下 Enter，可能让每一行单独提交。\n\n使用 --paste 时，文本会原样通过与 cmux paste 和 Cmd+V 相同的粘贴路径发送：不会解释 \\n 等转义序列，Esc 和 Ctrl-C 等控制字符会被替换为空格。--paste 必须放在文本之前。\n\n如果目标中的代理提示里有人正在输入文本，或有问题或权限对话框处于打开状态，则不会发送任何内容，命令会失败。使用 --force 可强制发送。\n\n标志：\n  --workspace <id|ref|index>   目标工作区（默认：$CMUX_WORKSPACE_ID）\n  --surface <id|ref|index>     目标表面（默认：$CMUX_SURFACE_ID）\n  --window <id|ref|index>      工作区/表面引用与索引的窗口上下文\n  --paste                      粘贴文本，而不是逐键输入\n  --force                      即使有草稿或对话框打开也发送\n\n示例：\n  cmux send \"echo hello\"\n  cmux send --surface surface:2 \"ls -la\\n\"\n  cmux send --paste --surface surface:2 \"$(cat notes.md)\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.send.hint.usePaste": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "hint: each newline was typed as Enter; for large multi-line text use cmux send --paste or cmux paste to deliver it as one paste"
