    "settings.terminal.showPasswordInputIndicator.subtitle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows a lock badge in the terminal corner while a program such as sudo or ssh reads a password with echo off. Only local prompts are detected: ssh's own password prompt counts, but sudo inside an ssh session does not."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当 sudo 或 ssh 等程序在关闭回显的情况下读取密码时，在终端角落显示锁形标记。仅检测本地提示：ssh 自身的密码提示会被检测，但 ssh 会话中的 sudo 不会。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.terminal.showPasswordInputDots.subtitle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows one dot in the badge per typed character. cmux keeps only a count, never the characters. Pasted text is not counted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在标记中为每个已输入的字符显示一个圆点。cmux 只保留数量，绝不保留字符本身。粘贴的文本不计入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.session.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux session move <session-id> --to <ssh-destination|local> [options]\n\nMove a stopped Claude Code session to another machine and resume it there.\nExit the agent first: the move refuses while the session runs on either side.\n\nThe move carries:\n  - the cwd's git checkout: HEAD (on the same branch when safe) plus modified,\n    deleted and untracked non-ignored files; a worktree is added when the\n    repository exists on the destination but the path does not\n  - the transcript, its session directory, file history, and the project\n    memory directory (merged both ways, newest wins, nothing deleted)\n\nIt then opens a workspace on the destination (`cmux ssh` for a host, a local\nworkspace for `local`) that resumes the session with its recorded launcher.\nWhen the destination home is not at the same absolute path, paths under the\nhome are mapped and the project is re-slugged.\n\nOptions:\n  --to <destination>      SSH destination (user@host or ssh_config alias), or local\n  --from <destination>    Where the session is now (default: where the last move put it, else local)\n  --name <title>          Workspace title (default: the first 8 characters of the id)\n  --no-code               Do not carry the git checkout\n  --port <n>              SSH port\n  --identity <path>       SSH identity file\n  --ssh-option <opt>      Extra SSH -o option (repeatable)\n  --no-focus              Open the workspace without switching to it\n\nExamples:\n  cmux session move 0b7a1e7c-3f0a-4c6e-9d59-8a0d8f7c2b11 --to dev@my-host\n  cmux session move 0b7a1e7c-3f0a-4c6e-9d59-8a0d8f7c2b11 --to local"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法: cmux session move <session-id> --to <ssh-destination|local> [options]\n\n将已停止的 Claude Code 会话移到另一台机器并在那里恢复。\n请先退出代理：只要会话仍在任一端运行，移动就会被拒绝。\n\n移动会带上：\n  - cwd 的 git 检出：HEAD（安全时使用同一分支）以及已修改、已删除\n    和未跟踪且未忽略的文件；若目标上有仓库\n    但没有该路径，会添加 worktree\n  - 会话记录、其会话目录、文件历史和项目记忆目录\n    （双向合并，较新者优先，不删除任何内容）\n\n随后在目标上打开工作区（主机用 `cmux ssh`，`local` 则打开本地工作区），\n用记录的启动器恢复会话。\n若目标的主目录不在相同的绝对路径，其下的路径会被映射，\n项目也会重新生成 slug。\n\n选项：\n  --to <destination>      SSH 目标（user@host 或 ssh_config 别名），或 local\n  --from <destination>    会话当前所在位置（默认：上次移动放置的位置，否则为 local）\n  --name <title>          工作区标题（默认：ID 的前 8 个字符）\n  --no-code               不带上 git 检出\n  --port <n>              SSH 端口\n  --identity <path>       SSH 身份文件\n  --ssh-option <opt>      额外的 SSH -o 选项（可重复）\n  --no-focus              打开工作区但不切换过去\n\n示例：\n  cmux session move 0b7a1e7c-3f0a-4c6e-9d59-8a0d8f7c2b11 --to dev@my-host\n  cmux session move 0b7a1e7c-3f0a-4c6e-9d59-8a0d8f7c2b11 --to local"
          }
        }
      }
    },
