            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 是此 cmux 当前正在保存的会话。运行不带 --from 的 cmux restore-session 以重新打开上次启动的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.session.help": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux session restore [--list] [--session <id>]...\n\nReopen Claude sessions that were running when cmux last quit unexpectedly.\ncmux finds them in the agent journal, skips any that are running or already\nopen, and resumes each in its own workspace through the launcher that started\nit.\n\nWithout --session, restore acts only after an unexpected quit.\n\nOptions:\n  --list            Show the sessions without restoring them.\n  --session <id>    Restore only this session (repeatable)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法： cmux session restore [--list] [--session <id>]...\n\n重新打开 cmux 上次意外退出时仍在运行的 Claude 会话。\ncmux 会从代理日志中找到它们，跳过仍在运行或已打开的会话，\n并通过最初启动它的启动器\n在各自的工作区中继续。\n\n未指定 --session 时，restore 只会在意外退出后执行。\n\n选项：\n  --list            只列出会话，不恢复。\n  --session <id>    只恢复此会话（可重复）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.session.error.expectedRestore": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "session: expected 'restore' (see cmux help session)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
