    "cli.help.agentInbox": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux agent inbox [--surface <target>] [--state queued|delivered|read|failed] [--limit <n>] [--mark-read] [--json]\n\nList agent messages, newest first. Without --surface, lists messages for\nevery surface. --mark-read marks the listed messages read."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法： cmux agent inbox [--surface <target>] [--state queued|delivered|read|failed] [--limit <n>] [--mark-read] [--json]\n\n列出代理消息，最新的在前。未指定 --surface 时，列出\n所有表面的消息。--mark-read 会将列出的消息标记为已读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.help.agentMessage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux agent message <target> [--from <name>] [--thread <id>] [--json] [--] <text|->\n       cmux agent message --reply-to <message-id> [--from <name>] [--json] [--] <text|->\n\nSend a message to the agent running in another workspace or surface. cmux\ndelivers it through that agent's hooks, never by typing into its terminal,\nso it cannot land in a half-typed prompt. An idle Claude Code session wakes\nup to read it; a busy one reads it at its next step.\n\n<target> is a workspace or surface id or ref (workspace:2, surface:5), or a\nworkspace title (exact, then a unique prefix). Use - to read the text from\nstdin. --from defaults to the sending workspace's title.\n\nExamples:\n  cmux agent message cmux-remote-status \"The relay fix is on main, rebase when free.\"\n  cmux agent message --reply-to 3f2a... \"Done, PR is #123.\""
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法： cmux agent message <target> [--from <name>] [--thread <id>] [--json] [--] <text|->\n       cmux agent message --reply-to <message-id> [--from <name>] [--json] [--] <text|->\n\n向在另一个工作区或表面中运行的代理发送消息。cmux\n通过该代理的 hook 投递消息，绝不会向它的终端输入按键，\n因此消息不会落入输入到一半的提示中。空闲的 Claude Code 会话会醒来\n阅读它；忙碌的会话会在下一步阅读。\n\n<target> 是工作区或表面的 ID 或引用（workspace:2、surface:5），或\n工作区标题（先完全匹配，再找唯一前缀）。使用 - 从\nstdin 读取文本。--from 默认为发送端工作区的标题。\n\n示例：\n  cmux agent message cmux-remote-status \"The relay fix is on main, rebase when free.\"\n  cmux agent message --reply-to 3f2a... \"Done, PR is #123.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
