          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "cmux pr 收到无效的拉取请求信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.pr.error.repositoryMismatch": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "cmux pr: the pull request does not belong to the detected repository"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "cmux pr：拉取请求不属于检测到的仓库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.pr.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux pr <url|number> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--window <id|ref|index>]\n       cmux pr clear [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--window <id|ref|index>]\n\nAttach or replace a pull-request link immediately. Requires a Git repository and account authentication.\nUses the repository associated with the current directory, including its configured upstream.\nTarget: explicit workspace, caller TTY, configured workspace, then a unique worktree match.\n--window restricts resolution; ambiguous targets fail without changing focus.\nThe manual link survives branch refreshes until replaced, cleared, or the session ends.\nThe existing watcher refreshes matching pull-request status. Clear removes only the manual link.\nSidebar visibility and click settings still apply.\n\nExample:\n  cmux pr 123\n  cmux pr clear"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法：cmux pr <url|number> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--window <id|ref|index>]\n       cmux pr clear [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--window <id|ref|index>]\n\n立即附加或替换拉取请求链接。需要 Git 仓库和已验证的登录状态。\n使用当前目录关联的仓库，包括已配置的上游。\n目标顺序：明确工作区、调用方 TTY、已配置工作区，然后是唯一匹配的 worktree。\n--window 限制搜索；目标不明确时会失败且不改变焦点。\n手动链接在分支刷新后仍然保留，直到被替换、清除或会话结束。\n现有监视器会更新匹配拉取请求的状态。clear 只移除手动链接。\n侧边栏显示和点击设置仍然适用。\n\n示例：\n  cmux pr 123\n  cmux pr clear"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.pr.error.workspaceMissing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Workspace not found; run cmux list-workspaces and retry with --workspace."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到工作区；请运行 cmux list-workspaces，然后使用 --workspace 重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
