    "cli.localZellij.usage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage: cmux local-zellij <start|attach|list|status|close> [session] [options]\n\nOpt-in local zellij sessions survive cmux quit, crash, and app updates. Ordinary cmux terminals are unchanged.\n\nstart <name> [--cwd <path>] [--command <shell>] [--detached]\nattach <name|--id <uuid>> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--focus <true|false>] [--headless] [--new-client]\nlist [--json]\nstatus <name|--id <uuid>> [--json]\nclose <name|--id <uuid>>\n\nThe registry and zellij socket directory live under ~/.cmux/local-zellij with user-only permissions. `attach --headless` hands the terminal directly to zellij for a client outside the cmux GUI."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用法: cmux local-zellij <start|attach|list|status|close> [session] [options]\n\n选择加入的本地 zellij 会话在 cmux 退出、崩溃和应用更新时仍能存活。普通的 cmux 终端不受影响。\n\nstart <name> [--cwd <path>] [--command <shell>] [--detached]\nattach <name|--id <uuid>> [--workspace <id|ref|index>] [--focus <true|false>] [--headless] [--new-client]\nlist [--json]\nstatus <name|--id <uuid>> [--json]\nclose <name|--id <uuid>>\n\n注册表和 zellij 套接字目录位于具有仅用户权限的 ~/.cmux/local-zellij 下。`attach --headless` 会将终端直接移交给 zellij，以便在 cmux GUI 之外运行客户端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
